---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import pricing from '../../data/pricing-2026.json';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Methodology & Pricing Sources | TokenScale"
  description="How TokenScale models LLM API prompt caching, GPU VRAM KV-cache sizing, cloud egress cliffs, RAG vector RAM, and realtime Voice AI pipelines."
  canonicalPath="/about/"
>
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Methodology &amp; Pricing Sources</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">
        Transparent mathematical models and versioned US Tier-1 list pricing powering all six TokenScale FinOps simulators.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-section" style="border-top:0;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Dataset version and update cadence</h2>
      <div class="formula-grid">
        <div>
          <h3>Centralized pricing source</h3>
          <p>
            Every simulator reads from a single versioned file (<code>src/data/pricing-2026.json</code>, currently <strong>v{pricing.metadata.version}</strong>, last verified <strong>{pricing.metadata.lastUpdated}</strong>). All figures are denominated in {pricing.metadata.currency} using published on-demand list pricing for US primary regions.
          </p>
          <p>
            Calculations run 100% locally in your browser with zero external network calls, zero third-party fonts, and zero analytics trackers.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Engineering boundaries</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Monthly billing periods use 30 days for token/call volume and 730 hours for continuous GPU instances.</li>
            <li>GPU VRAM and HNSW index footprints use binary GiB (1024^3 bytes) to match <code>nvidia-smi</code> and Linux RSS metrics.</li>
            <li>Cloud object storage and egress use decimal TB (1,000 GB) to match AWS S3, Cloudflare R2, Backblaze B2, and GCS invoices.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Published LLM API rate snapshot (USD / 1M tokens)</h2>
      <div class="table-wrap" style="border-top:0;padding-top:0;">
        <table class="data-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Model</th>
              <th>Provider</th>
              <th>Tier</th>
              <th class="num">Input / 1M</th>
              <th class="num">Cached in / 1M</th>
              <th class="num">Output / 1M</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {pricing.llmApiModels.map((m) => (
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <strong>{m.name}</strong>
                  {'tierNote' in m && m.tierNote && (
                    <div style="font-size:var(--text-sm);color:var(--ink-secondary);margin-top:2px;">{m.tierNote}</div>
                  )}
                </td>
                <td>{m.provider}</td>
                <td>{m.tier}</td>
                <td class="num">${m.inputPer1M.toFixed(2)}</td>
                <td class="num">${m.cachedInputPer1M.toFixed(4)}</td>
                <td class="num">${m.outputPer1M.toFixed(2)}</td>
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
